"the end of his chapter, he had revealed himself as a helplessly worthless child."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫그랬지……, ⟪k:2⟫멜은 선량한 청년이었지만 ⟪k:3⟫끝에 가선 아주 구제불능 대사를 쳤어……."

