#: omake:omake_144794EF_6F90_4486_983B_6646972FE572
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: dd1df928914ca274ef1438dc2e91ffab74fbe8824dc29e759d6fded2f9b059cd
